    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/lms-education-elementor/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "LMS Education is a modern and powerful website theme built for online learning platforms, teaching institutes, tutoring services, training centers, learning management systems, academic websites, life coaching programs, wellness coaching, and professional education services. Designed to deliver an excellent user experience, it focuses on usability, flexibility, and performance, making it suitable for both beginners and experienced educators. The theme features a fully responsive layout, ensuring courses and educational content are accessible across desktops, tablets, and smartphones for seamless learning anywhere. It offers extensive customization options, including color schemes, typography, layout controls, and logo settings, allowing institutions to create a professional and branded learning platform. The theme supports structured course organization and multimedia content such as videos, images, and audio to create engaging and interactive lessons. Optimized for search engines with clean code and fast loading speed, it helps improve visibility and reach. Compatibility with popular LMS plugins like LearnPress, Tutor LMS, and WPLMS enhances course management, while reliable support ensures a smooth experience for delivering high-quality online education.Demo: https://preview.wpelemento.com/lms-education-elementor/"
    },
